8. PORTFOLIO FUNCTIONALITY

The artwork system is controlled through JavaScript.

The general workflow is:

Artwork Data
to
Portfolio Rendering
to
Search and Filtering
to
Artwork Selection
to
Artwork Modal
to
Artwork Details

This structure allows artwork to be added or modified without manually rebuilding the complete portfolio layout.

