13. DEPLOYMENT

The website is intended to be deployed using GitHub Pages.

Before deployment, all internal paths, images, scripts, stylesheets, forms, navigation links, and SEO files should be tested.

14. MAINTENANCE

When adding artwork:

* Add the image.
* Add the artwork data.
* Assign a category.
* Add a title.
* Add a description.
* Add descriptive alternative text.
* Test the artwork card.
* Test the modal.
* Test search and filtering.

When adding a page:

* Add navigation if required.
* Add SEO metadata.
* Add canonical URL.
* Add the page to sitemap.xml.
* Test internal links.
* Test responsive behavior.

